      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e6eb7510f047b1010e3484",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸好这套衣服的材质相当坚韧，\r\n即使用力刷洗也不会变形。",
      "source_fingerprint": "163202eb857128fde79f04b93f89bdce5105075c89bb38ce8ccd4476d8bdee8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34eb1358c8fd00f0e510db45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在雨中，\r\n这套决胜服也很显眼对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fcbe4693348fed06d8eedf33fa77fb1fa61179ec079f01ff9ac15e333bf0254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d07e64e296ca7cf7117e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我也喜欢这件呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e9a9c39cda5cdd1d833a604e87ce91c5e5fce79e77405095e8d256cd4768cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b970fa9489d19cf7dffe2a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多衣服的话，会很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2f081302c44e90264110e668971530d6e2c7e1fae4820e3ef2a578f9063872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca490367e153962adb8768e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f91abeb437a4bd5caeaa449",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシと走りたい？\r\nいいよ。楽しいレースにしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1abec740bfc53988ebae9295fc4b7d4f79b8bc6e48e01770c097eae5ab3f97f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a57aa05d87f6cc8fbab3d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいね、キミの走りも。\r\nけど、アタシより\r\n自由に走れるかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32851fa22df6788ff670a0c95432d648be11f959db8281ff8a5f7e40a7ab5ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9057a91368c7c96a286c902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n我用我的步伐、你用你的步伐，\r\n今天也一起迈步向前吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f605885855934761044db0bbd6f1f79168664224550b1320aaae20cd0ddaa896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd3a3449e734efa09800d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是美好的早晨呢。\r\n天空宛如没有边际般辽阔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "344bb965ae118a5d80dd7ff1a41a149caa549b2dc3c8ab60f0bafe51d2b03e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8869229092b6bdfbaaa1b7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你待会要做什么呢？\r\n如果目的地相同的话，\r\n一起散步过去也挺不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1759315652639d65a6523e855b8ae1304d5358e158ceeb7ce5057a6ff0d5efa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ee6e143142abd2a26b2305d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天的午餐太好吃，\r\n不小心吃太多了。\r\n……算了，多跑跑就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c4b89a298e0f8a187caf2c6315f1e1932863cb366a0397c9d8233053d8db82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0314aa84678d817ba3c0557a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是因为安静的缘故吧，\r\n我能够清楚听见彼此的声音呢。\r\n要不要再稍微聊聊天呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b21ac1c291a42b5e5f1e9e2a4e4abbefa0dba4d7c1e37ee413136a9c415329",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3cc59d5ab06e554759e1817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的事就留待明天再想吧。毕竟\r\n会发生什么事，到头来还是得等到\r\n当下才会知道，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "883ccde925c64dd2ef1e50a81eaf14859dcb21fb390e746c98b1b66abc1dedd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0917025f44ba5f2e745dcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论去到哪个地方，都充满着\r\n缤纷的色彩呢。可以的话，\r\n我真不想错过任何景色啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b4561f82936c28a7fbc11c257e2190b9578eb709cc8d471d4b1f78b9cc1a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1513d525900f5a1ac96e7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有多耀眼，就有多哀伤。\r\n季节的更迭对我来说，\r\n就是充满了这样的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ea5609f1be9fc72fdb7a3b4849f4a37edfc44eb317d55304efe70a74599bcfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d407d75556fcbf1834d6482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多事都会渐渐随风而逝……\r\n让我觉得时间过得比平常还快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45a4001716f81beac7016ada93ce203c9fcb63399a2e84a380ebc1b019176c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4086373cde5577746da56aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "空气干燥，指尖冰冷……\r\n为了至少让身体暖和起来，\r\n稍微去跑一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0f4d303d90fea996cba1bb1f11488b45d812b83ab9f8561a551eaf4fa4b65a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ad84e79c41c14779715003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4a2c74f8d8a52bdd0731ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌真的是个很温柔的人呢。\r\n她还提醒我今天是交作业的期限……\r\n啊，我还没有交耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3111add54148765d6fa4aba27fa22e5f652cc9f0a7d311c04221f9b7f2a80a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b25b4200d799126f2e8d239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是想一起乐在其中而已……\r\n但我的想法却迟迟无法\r\n传达给鲁道夫知道呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11835d8983f967df3cff4fa4cd267117b2178ea71cdfcbe6b382da754beb88c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19fbb4065628a237520e373b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "独居生活很不错喔。如果我住宿舍，\r\n大概每天都会因为违规被骂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47c238450b46fd20342871d8de709f08cd7db8a4fd372d2fdd8ac0d204dde07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0c2a93fd1d450a45646118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有时候会与红宝、变革聊天。\r\n明明我们的个性大相径庭，\r\n但聚在一起就很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ba67a20bbc7c49e4250e79f7fe5c6cd9706dc4283ba671663c4ce9e1e4e1a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b21017e42d252086097622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有间很喜欢的咖啡厅，\r\n但每次去都客满，\r\n最后只能放弃回家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76a7bb261c2ba1c37bf086e8af44f27a7dec8f0fc8c1caa4bef0bf070d801db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc2b022db1383ef49aee2fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的设计很棒吧？\r\n腰部周围不受拘束，非常舒适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8d0b814eb57f7c0e61fe186456ef1a8d4df9369b465918eba34fea17f2b9b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f42f5a3e3eef548d27b69ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要跳舞，\r\n果然还是在正中央跳\r\n最开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb60a4b5b925240b596068fe98c9414223faff57128a74ac85e39c06685f4b15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ff266cc1477d4842d4e876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套衣服，我感觉自己\r\n就像身处在世界的中心，\r\n可以随时奔驰到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16594ec95ce26e9768c4f57d4eb149040396c3fb6bfc87b776f38603d0f386ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549489183513dcc050e268d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的父母经常来观看竞赛。\r\n当他们从观众席上与我对到眼时，\r\n就会流露出温柔又开心的样子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a06674d1ea068ca4fa020fd85b72d7ae53e6f8e948406b1884d0c6154149e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3389050ced789c13098eccab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨泡澡很舒服呢。\r\n那会让我有一种只有我在\r\n尽情享受那段时间的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae6ac0391dde0854737f69b8cab945eb049aca074ba26d5e13686693b09fb6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcc8f8d298cbb12508eb8e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着树梢摇曳的方向走去，\r\n找寻最为合适的地方。这么一来，\r\n午餐也会变得像是在野餐一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c99e4735f35b9d1dfa78d42fcdcb5bb8937efd92c3fecc03f0e222428847a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3869ba696e527e9d03b9ffec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天晚上都会保养脚趾甲哦。\r\n因为我不希望自己变得没办法跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6f3d7817ac7ee0d4e9167573b6fe80b7b9f91b4c9866e6158d4d479b656e38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49de0fe6abd6eecff72b443b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有预感接下来会发生许多事情……\r\n尽管这个时期令人眼花撩乱，\r\n但同时也让内心雀跃无比呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d23690c37485e63d6ee12099876b839e53f383497932f0e58ca49bb35376e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae48785021d4717f5da160cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是个会让人想追寻轨迹的季节呢。\r\n……你懂这种感觉吗？\r\n不懂也完全没关系哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2056e990eab7b7c02d8de3a0df3471b4a5cca585945ec2dd407b2d5888125e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d52a1cd62d13f6eda3c108aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落叶被风吹了过来，\r\n我不小心像蓑衣虫那样缩了起来。\r\n丸善却说那样「很可爱」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c2c6ea77840bc101f34b69f5d47b414329277a2c45164bfbc62f11a1383155",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8485e2d5fc1dd2549643ddbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一个季节即将到来了呢。\r\n至于要前往哪里，\r\n就等我迈出脚步后再决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "171931458071d1e97fbfd896e2d383b9edd4bc180bfd1746d82881d036e3ea2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb740f27fba308138701db2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，开始吧。\r\n做到我满意为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9245f91b9157b8a841034af2fbad56f7413aacec7b564f6381925ba1e769d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1d0eb79ecebcb3722f4911",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行こうか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "818fd86e117bf5c997896dd7e70da749c9d81263c79a506c4c52b202dfff60f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3e0c2f9013b5860a8b0fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以告诉我训练项目吗？\r\n虽然我不知道能不能\r\n照你所说的完成就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea501110f376c5ba6963fb5c5f8eaad4f4d77406f5d2a804e75957845b32094f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f81717a391236fdceb4681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，可以去跑一跑了吗？\r\n我已经快要克制不住自己了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "628d6235cf612cc77c91f776ec7239a98da70fe77c55e7c952efe1b0d2f1f231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89338d2c597a076dfb6ac03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～～清新的空气\r\n充满了身体各个角落……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe2fc0e23c70405be83b6ea8b74dd26527c37f20f8d08fd78302c73cdeb79ff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a752e38f603773196ea8b36f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛道上有许多凹凸不平之处。\r\n我想它至今为止\r\n一定承受过各种跑法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "363f3de924cd7aecf05f800ff671129a127e383f3385704c034a63ac586e21dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413e89b1d6d00b73ae3a7ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像我有属于自己的跑法一样，\r\n我也想看看那些\r\n只有你才能做到的事情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4d023f725f407e9b5a87ba927596cca96c4667871c7dbd84d6f0c826fb907b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50b46f2d6715d1392e5b049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去描绘我的梦想，\r\n而你也看着属于你的梦想，\r\n这样最适合我们了……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c2198c3a5f121d3fff4ef15890ad49c58b7845feb84619adf0a8bcf69aec50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a2138c3f947e9dc29cff5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里可真是辽阔呢。\r\n感觉能够做比平常更多的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758112d165e8e553c6d33ce9211841c589d879b66a227e7a21ee5b1be3717603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21040622b2fabfc4d126156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很庆幸我的伙伴是你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1acd33d3a5f55c7f65e0ac6d55c54907f24e115dbbfdd5215ec0e0a1cbb9cf71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35677093edaa4e646f1643aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有你，我才能自由奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37a44f38a929cc3c2e5e22ff3d65539ee7cf2455274125dcfcfe026d1853b2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271f82ef2ae39b3fa6b0e33f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉非常畅快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54863152a5c1c38bf39d3fa77f6c836701d9e8a664c5e133ffd6ca6cb8f6418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e1ac16efa767deeaedd6204",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎能更加展翅高飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4f19f8c3cca3a44eda73059b9d5cd4b1981e0a05be592c1bc719eb1a9bd53c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813cc9486fc15f5ce7f5d0f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是千明代表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82fc356aac3ed21f7e530e04ba835e4076b38a24d19a4f086a7b9ca54facf95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
